{#- Study-guide engine · tabs 7–11: grammar practice, word order, reading, writing, report. -#}
  <!-- 7 · PRACTICE -->
  <section class="tab-content" id="tab-practice">
    <div class="ls-card"><div class="ls-card-head"><h2>Luyện ngữ pháp · Grammar practice</h2><span class="ls-right" id="practice-score"></span></div><div class="ls-card-body">
      <p class="ls-instr">Chọn đáp án đúng. Bạn sẽ thấy lời giải thích sau mỗi câu. · Choose the best answer. An explanation appears after each question.</p>
      <div id="practice-box"></div>
      <div class="row"><button type="button" class="btn primary" id="practice-redo">Làm lại · Try again</button></div>
    </div></div>
  </section>

  <!-- 8 · ARRANGE -->
  <section class="tab-content" id="tab-arrange">
    <div class="ls-card"><div class="ls-card-head"><h2>Sắp xếp từ · Word arrangement</h2><span class="ls-right" id="arrange-score"></span></div><div class="ls-card-body">
      <p class="ls-instr">Bấm các từ theo thứ tự để tạo thành một câu đúng. Bấm từ trong ô trả lời để bỏ ra. Sáu câu này giống dạng câu trong bài thi. · Tap the words in order to build a correct sentence. Tap a word in the answer box to take it back. These six items match the exam format.</p>
      <div id="arrange-box"></div>
    </div></div>
  </section>

  <!-- 9 · READING (built by the engine from SG.reads) -->
  <section class="tab-content" id="tab-reading"></section>

  <!-- 10 · WRITING (heading, instructions and topic chips come from SG.writing / SG.topics) -->
  <section class="tab-content" id="tab-writing">
    <div class="ls-card"><div class="ls-card-head"><h2 id="write-head"></h2></div><div class="ls-card-body">
      <p class="ls-instr" id="write-instr"></p>
      <div class="row" id="write-chips" style="margin-bottom:14px"></div>
      <div id="write-topic"></div>
      <h3>Viết bài của bạn · Write your answer</h3>
